{'symbol': 'MMC', 'date': '2023-03-06 16:25:00', 'title': 'MARSH MCLENNAN ANNOUNCES PRICING OF $600 MILLION SENIOR NOTES OFFERING', 'text': 'NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--MARSH MCLENNAN (NYSE: MMC) (THE “COMPANY”) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT HAS PRICED $600,000,000 AGGREGATE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OF ITS 5.450% SENIOR NOTES DUE 2053 (THE “NOTES”). THE COMPANY INTENDS TO USE THE NET PROCEEDS FROM THE NOTES OFFERING FOR GENERAL CORPORATE PURPOSES. THE CLOSING OF THE NOTES OFFERING IS EXPECTED TO OCCUR ON MARCH 9, 2023, SUBJECT TO THE SATISFACTION OF CERTAIN CUSTOMARY CLOSING CONDITIONS. BARCLAYS CAPITAL INC., HSBC SECURITIES (USA) INC.'}